{"id":"p1m3","name":"Orders per customer","lang":"pyspark","entry":"solve","params":["spark","orders_df"],"limit_s":30,"ordered":true,"desc":"<p><code>orders_df</code> has the columns <code>order_id</code> (string), <code>customer_id</code> (string) and <code>amount</code> (double).</p>\n<p>Return one row per customer with <code>customer_id</code>, <code>n_orders</code> (number of orders) and <code>total</code> (sum of <code>amount</code>, rounded to 2 decimals), sorted by <code>total</code> descending, then <code>customer_id</code> ascending.</p>\n<h4>Example</h4><p><code>orders_df</code>:</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>order_id</th><th>customer_id</th><th>amount</th></tr><tr><td>O1</td><td>C1</td><td>10.0</td></tr><tr><td>O2</td><td>C2</td><td>25.5</td></tr><tr><td>O3</td><td>C1</td><td>15.5</td></tr><tr><td>O4</td><td>C3</td><td>5.0</td></tr></table></div><p>the output should be</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>customer_id</th><th>n_orders</th><th>total</th></tr><tr><td>C1</td><td>2</td><td>25.5</td></tr><tr><td>C2</td><td>1</td><td>25.5</td></tr><tr><td>C3</td><td>1</td><td>5.0</td></tr></table></div><div class=\"lim\"><b>[execution time limit]</b> 30 seconds (pyspark)<br><b>[memory limit]</b> 2 GB</div>","starter":"from pyspark.sql import SparkSession, DataFrame, functions as F\n\n\ndef solve(spark: SparkSession, orders_df: DataFrame) -> DataFrame:\n    # write your code here\n    return orders_df\n","hints":["groupBy(\"customer_id\").agg(F.count(\"*\").alias(...), F.round(F.sum(...), 2).alias(...))","Tri décroissant : .orderBy(F.col(\"total\").desc(), \"customer_id\")."],"summary_fr":"Une ligne par client : nombre de commandes et total arrondi à 2 décimales. Trie par total décroissant puis customer_id.","tags":["groupBy / agg","orderBy"],"minutes":5,"source":"Kata Lab","files":null,"visible":[{"input":{"orders_df":{"__df__":{"schema":"order_id STRING, customer_id STRING, amount DOUBLE","rows":[["O1","C1",10.0],["O2","C2",25.5],["O3","C1",15.5],["O4","C3",5.0]]}}},"expected":{"columns":["customer_id","n_orders","total"],"rows":[["C1",2,25.5],["C2",1,25.5],["C3",1,5.0]]}},{"input":{"orders_df":{"__df__":{"schema":"order_id STRING, customer_id STRING, amount DOUBLE","rows":[["O1","B",10.0],["O2","A",10.0]]}}},"expected":{"columns":["customer_id","n_orders","total"],"rows":[["A",1,10.0],["B",1,10.0]]}}],"hidden_n":4,"hidden":"","solution":""}